{"id":47851,"date":"2026-01-09T09:17:46","date_gmt":"2026-01-09T08:17:46","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=47851"},"modified":"2026-08-23T22:49:56","modified_gmt":"2026-08-23T21:49:56","slug":"caminhada-corrida-do-coracao-uic-covilha","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/caminhada-corrida-do-coracao-uic-covilha\/","title":{"rendered":"Caminhada \/ Corrida do Cora\u00e7\u00e3o &#8211; UIC Covilh\u00e3 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A &#8220;Caminhada \/ Corrida do Cora\u00e7\u00e3o&#8221; \u00e9 um evento de lazer e sensibiliza\u00e7\u00e3o para a sa\u00fade, promovido pela Unidade de Interven\u00e7\u00e3o Cardiovascular da ULS Cova da Beira, que celebra o 2\u00ba anivers\u00e1rio nesta data.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Local de Partida e Chegada: Parque Multiusos Duppigheim &#8211; Boidobra.<br>Hor\u00e1rio: Concentra\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e0s 9h e partida \u00e0s 9h30.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Percurso: Circular, com aproximadamente 8 km, de dificuldade baixa\/moderada, sempre de frente para a encosta da nossa bela Serra da Estrela.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":48878,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[],"event_type_2":[535,727,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-47851","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-covilha-castelo-branco","event_type_2-castelo-branco","event_type_2-lisboa-e-centro","event_type_2-portugal"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/6978ee40d20aa_cartaz-cartaz_460.jpg","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2